{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 41,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        126.61820220947266,
        27.289522171020508,
        326.90234375,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "5. EVIDENCE FOR RECOMMENDATIONS ON THE NEWBORN CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        60.372276306152344,
        231.48292541503906,
        72.36227416992188
      ],
      "text": "5.4.1\t Evidence and summary of findings",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        75.89693450927734,
        399.1028137207031,
        89.51692962646484
      ],
      "text": "Association between serum bilirubin levels and adverse neurodevelopmental outcomes:",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        89.02693176269531,
        399.05303955078125,
        102.51692962646484
      ],
      "text": "The systematic review by the National Institute of Health and Clinical Excellence",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        102.02693176269531,
        396.8504943847656,
        115.51692962646484
      ],
      "text": "(NICE), UK, and four additional studies were identified. Three observational stud­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        115.02693176269531,
        399.1327819824219,
        128.51693725585938
      ],
      "text": "ies evaluated the association of high serum bilirubin levels (> 340 micro mol/litre)",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        128.0269317626953,
        399.1626281738281,
        141.51693725585938
      ],
      "text": "with adverse sequelae: two studies were in term babies and one in babies with birth",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        141.0269317626953,
        399.093017578125,
        154.51693725585938
      ],
      "text": "weight less than 1000 g. One study in term babies found no statistically significant",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        154.0269317626953,
        396.8504943847656,
        167.51693725585938
      ],
      "text": "association between hyperbilirubinaemia and IQ, abnormal neurological examina­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        167.0269012451172,
        399.142822265625,
        180.51690673828125
      ],
      "text": "tion, or sensorineural hearing loss. Another study reported severe jaundice requiring",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        180.0269012451172,
        396.8504943847656,
        193.51690673828125
      ],
      "text": "exchange transfusion and early onset of jaundice as statistically significant risk fac­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        193.0269012451172,
        399.0928039550781,
        206.51690673828125
      ],
      "text": "tors for hearing loss. The third study found a weak association between high serum",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        206.0269012451172,
        396.8504943847656,
        219.51690673828125
      ],
      "text": "bilirubin levels and neurodevelopmental impairment, hearing impairment, and psy­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        219.0269012451172,
        396.8504943847656,
        232.51690673828125
      ],
      "text": "chomotor impairment in babies with birth weight less than 1000 g. The NICE Guide­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        232.0269012451172,
        399.0528564453125,
        245.51690673828125
      ],
      "text": "lines Development Group (NICE GDG) concluded that term neonates with serum",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        245.0269012451172,
        338.65289306640625,
        258.51690673828125
      ],
      "text": "bilirubin > 340 micro mol/litre are at an increased risk of kernicterus.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        263.56622314453125,
        399.12554931640625,
        277.18621826171875
      ],
      "text": "Age-specific bilirubin cut-offs for instituting phototherapy or exchange transfusion:  Two",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        276.6961975097656,
        396.8504943847656,
        290.18621826171875
      ],
      "text": "randomized trials relevant for this question were identified. One high quality study ad­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        289.6961975097656,
        399.1203918457031,
        303.18621826171875
      ],
      "text": "dressed this question in extremely low birth weight neonatal population (birth weight",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        302.6961975097656,
        396.8504943847656,
        316.18621826171875
      ],
      "text": "< 1000 gm; constituting < 1% of total newborn population) showing no role of ag­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        315.6961975097656,
        396.8504943847656,
        329.18621826171875
      ],
      "text": "gressive phototherapy. The other trial found that there was little advantage in start­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        328.6961975097656,
        399.0927429199219,
        342.18621826171875
      ],
      "text": "ing phototherapy early in babies with birth weight greater than 2500g. This evidence",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        341.6961975097656,
        396.8504943847656,
        355.18621826171875
      ],
      "text": "indicates that the currently used conventional cut-offs do not need to be further re­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        354.6961975097656,
        399.06280517578125,
        368.18621826171875
      ],
      "text": "duced. However, the “conventional” cut-offs are somewhat different than those in",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        367.56622314453125,
        397.9201965332031,
        381.18621826171875
      ],
      "text": "Pocket Book the current version of the  . No direct evidence is available for the cut-off",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        380.6961975097656,
        399.02288818359375,
        394.18621826171875
      ],
      "text": "for exchange transfusion. The consensus cut-offs developed by the NICE GDG for",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        393.6961975097656,
        399.1328125,
        407.18621826171875
      ],
      "text": "exchange transfusions are somewhat lower than those in the current version of the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        406.56622314453125,
        107.45569610595703,
        420.18621826171875
      ],
      "text": "Pocket Book .",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        431.2148132324219,
        163.96286010742188,
        443.2048034667969
      ],
      "text": "5.4.2\t Benefits and risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        446.8594055175781,
        88.77290344238281,
        458.9993896484375
      ],
      "text": "Benefits",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        459.869384765625,
        399.0528259277344,
        473.3594055175781
      ],
      "text": "Lower cut-offs for phototherapy may avoid the need for exchange transfusion in",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        472.869384765625,
        399.02294921875,
        486.3594055175781
      ],
      "text": "the majority of infants with jaundice. Lower cut-offs for exchange transfusion may",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        485.869384765625,
        396.7828674316406,
        499.3594055175781
      ],
      "text": "prevent some additional cases of kernicterus; but there is no evidence for the best cut-",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        498.869384765625,
        219.31292724609375,
        512.359375
      ],
      "text": "off which has to be agreed by consensus.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        520.3634033203125,
        78.65290069580078,
        532.50341796875
      ],
      "text": "Risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        533.3734130859375,
        399.0929260253906,
        546.8634033203125
      ],
      "text": "Aggressive phototherapy may not be beneficial and may be associated with adverse",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        546.3734130859375,
        197.61288452148438,
        559.8634033203125
      ],
      "text": "effects in non-specialized settings.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        570.8919677734375,
        207.80299377441406,
        582.8820190429688
      ],
      "text": "5.4.3\t Acceptability and feasibility",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        586.5465698242188,
        306.8728942871094,
        600.0365600585938
      ],
      "text": "Exchange transfusion is only possible in tertiary care settings.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        223.48260498046875,
        644.9403076171875,
        231.56460571289062,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "27",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}